      "id": 1,
      "text": "Hongdae grew around Hongik University, a fine‑arts school that drew artists in the 1990s.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        9
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hongdae_(area)",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The 1996 opening of Hongik University subway station made the area far more accessible, sparking a boom in visitors.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        5
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://travelsetu.com/guide/hongdae-tourism/hongdae-tourism-history",
      "category": "transport",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "In the mid‑1990s, indie bands Sister's Barbershop and Crying Nut launched Hongdae’s first underground music scene.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        18
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hongdae_(area)",
      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The “Red Road” on Hongdae’s main street showcases gaming arcades, karaoke, and fortune‑teller shops, a hallmark of its nightlife.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        6
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hongdae_(area)",
      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Zandari Festa, named after an old Hongdae nickname, is a yearly music festival that celebrates the district’s indie roots.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        7
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hongdae_(area)",
      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "Hongdae’s streets are covered in graffiti murals, turning the neighborhood into a living gallery of urban art.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        30
